### PPT Master skill payload (12917 files / ~79MB unpacked). Kept out of git
### for size; it is BUNDLED INTO THE APP at build time from this directory, so
### it must be staged before `npm run build:*`:
###     node scripts/prepare-ppt-master-package.mjs --from <ppt-master checkout>
### electron-builder warns loudly when it is absent (hard-fails when
### CLAUDE360_REQUIRE_PPT_MASTER=1); a build without it ships no PPT skill.
packages/ppt-master-skill/ppt-master/
packages/ppt-master-skill/*.tgz
